    // unit -- dividing a percentage (relative to the column) by a pixel value
    // (absolute) produces a number that looks like a ratio but isn't one.
    // Applying that "ratio" to the other field then corrupts it -- e.g. an
    // old preset's width:"100%" combined with a resized height:"51px" would
    // compute width as several thousand percent. Bail out to independent
